
task get
  like text

  send back
    call rust-current-dir

task set
  take path, like text

  call rust-set-current-dir
    read path

task rust-current-dir
  note private
  dock call <std::env::current_dir().unwrap().to_string_lossy().to_string()>

task rust-set-current-dir
  note private
  take path, like text
  dock call <std::env::set_current_dir(&path).unwrap()>
